WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:20.718
The king's mother came for a visit.

2
00:00:20.719 --> 00:00:22.815
"Dirk!" said the king.

3
00:00:22.816 --> 00:00:27.232
"Make sure the royal grandmother is happy."

4
00:00:27.233 --> 00:00:34.348
"Of course," said Dirk.

5
00:00:34.349 --> 00:00:37.746
But the royal grandmother was never happy.

6
00:00:37.747 --> 00:00:56.565
"My throne is too small!" she said.

7
00:00:56.566 --> 00:00:59.542
"I need a guard for my room.

8
00:00:59.543 --> 00:01:02.841
Where is my feast?"

9
00:01:02.842 --> 00:01:08.441
"Dirk!" yelled the king. "Do something!"

10
00:01:08.442 --> 00:01:12.068
Dirk ran to Tom's room.

11
00:01:12.069 --> 00:01:16.771
He pounded on the door. "Wizard!"

12
00:01:16.772 --> 00:01:18.893
"Uh-oh," thought Tom.

13
00:01:18.894 --> 00:01:22.077
"Help the royal grandmother," Dirk ordered.

14
00:01:22.077 --> 00:01:27.023
"Make sure she is happy!"

15
00:01:27.024 --> 00:01:30.049
Tom ran to find the royal grandmother.

16
00:01:30.050 --> 00:01:31.694
Dirk grinned.

17
00:01:31.695 --> 00:01:35.410
"No one can make the royal grandmother happy.

18
00:01:35.411 --> 00:01:45.331
Soon the king will throw Tom in the Grim Dungeon!"

19
00:01:45.332 --> 00:01:48.657
The royal grandmother frowned at Tom.

20
00:01:48.658 --> 00:01:52.173
"I need a bigger throne, Wizard!"

21
00:01:52.174 --> 00:01:54.930
Tom waved his wand.

22
00:01:54.931 --> 00:02:00.648
Poof! The throne grew bigger.

23
00:02:00.649 --> 00:02:04.364
Boom! The ceiling crashed down.

24
00:02:04.365 --> 00:02:08.306
"Oops!" Tom said, waving his hand.

25
00:02:08.307 --> 00:02:11.621
The throne got small again.

26
00:02:11.622 --> 00:02:16.720
"You are a terrible wizard," the royal grandmother snapped.

27
00:02:16.721 --> 00:02:23.250
"Now my bed is covered with dust.

28
00:02:23.251 --> 00:02:24.975
Look at my nightcap!

29
00:02:24.976 --> 00:02:27.196
It's a mess."

30
00:02:27.197 --> 00:02:36.293
"I will get you a new nightcap," Tom said.

31
00:02:36.294 --> 00:02:48.320
He ran to the market.

32
00:02:48.321 --> 00:02:52.225
He bought a nightcap from a man.

33
00:02:52.226 --> 00:02:55.927
"Hmm . . ." Cat sniffed the nightcap.

34
00:02:55.928 --> 00:02:58.622
"It smells like magic."

35
00:02:58.623 --> 00:03:04.477
Tom laughed. "Don't be silly, Cat.

36
00:03:04.478 --> 00:03:11.501
It's just a nightcap!"

